msgctxt "396"
msgid "Hey, buddy! You're the one who bought that bag, aren'tcha?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "Oh, yeah. I remember you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "So pal, I gotta ask⑬you got that bag with you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "I don't have it anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "What? Where is it? No... You gotta be kidding me..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "What, was there something in it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "516"
msgid ""
"Oh, uh, no! Nope, nothing like that!\r\n"
"Everything's fine!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid ""
"Look, uh, totally unrelated, but I gotta skip town. I mean, right now. So "
"catch you later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid "(What was that all about...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Not on me, no."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "What? Where is it? Go on, go get it⑬and hurry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Whoa, relax. Was there something in there?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Don't worry about it! Just hurry up and bring me the bag!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "684"
msgid "(What was that all about...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "732"
msgid "This bag, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Yes! Yes, that's the one! Oh, I'm so glad you still have it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "As it happens, I had this bag appraised. Turns out it was a fake."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "What!? Uh... I can't believe this! Did I seriously sell you a fake?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"I sure am sorry about that. How about I buy it back for... 70,000 yen? "
"Y'know, by way of apology."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "70,000 yen, eh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid "Sounds good to me. It's all yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "828"
msgid "Thanks much! Here you go⑬70,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"You handed over the <Color:8>Imitation Bag<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"You got <Color:8>70,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "864"
msgid "Well, better be going. Catch you later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "888"
msgid "(What was that all about...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "I don't think so."
msgstr "Non credo proprio."

msgctxt "972"
msgid ""
"Urk...! Okay, how about a little extra for all your trouble? 100,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"That's right, I'll buy it back for 100,000 yen! Not bad for a counterfeit, "
"am I right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "1008"
msgid "Sounds good to me."
msgstr "Mi sembra buono."

msgctxt "1020"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you! Thank you so much! I owe you for this⑬you have no idea... "
"Here's your 100,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1032"
msgid ""
"You handed over the <Color:8>Imitation Bag<Color:Default> and got "
"<Color:8>100,000<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Well, better be going. Catch you later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "(What was that all about...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid "No, thanks."
msgstr "No, grazie."

msgctxt "1164"
msgid ""
"But why not? C'mon, buddy, cut me some slack! It's 100,000 yen of pure "
"profit!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid "Even so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid ""
"Then I'll double it! 200,000 yen! C'mon, you can't say no to a deal like "
"that! I really need that bag back, buddy!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1200"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "1212"
msgid "That's more like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you! Thank you so much! I owe you for this⑬you have no idea... "
"Here's your 200,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236"
msgid ""
"You handed over the <Color:8>Imitation Bag<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"You got <Color:8>200,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid "Well, better be going. Catch you later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1284"
msgid "(What was that all about...?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1332"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1356"
msgid "Not happening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368"
msgid "But it's 200,000 yen! How can you do this to me, man!? I need it back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380"
msgid "Even so."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1392"
msgid ""
"...Look, buddy. This is your last chance. You get 200,000 yen, I get the bag"
" back. We both walk away happy. Please."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404"
msgid "Hmm..."
msgstr "Uhm..."

msgctxt "1416"
msgid "Yeah, fair enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1428"
msgid ""
"Oh, thank you! Thank you so much! I owe you for this⑬you have no idea... "
"Here's your 200,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1440"
msgid ""
