msgstr ""

msgctxt "1536"
msgid "You got 5,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1560"
msgid "Sorry. Not happening."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1572"
msgid ""
"Well, congratulations, buddy! You got me! I'm screwed! Hope it was fucking "
"worth it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1584"
msgid ""
"You think this is funny? You should have just let me buy the bag... Now we "
"gotta do this the hard way!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1608"
msgid "So, hey... how about you sell me that bag for 70,000 yen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1620"
msgid "70,000 yen, huh...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1632"
msgid "Sounds good to me. It's all yours."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1644"
msgid "Thanks much! Here you go⑬70,000 yen!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1656"
msgid ""
"You handed over the <Color:8>Platinum Bag<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"You got <Color:8>70,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1680"
msgid "Well, I better be going... Catch you later!"
msgstr ""

